When you avoid a melee blow while unarmed, you have a [18%, 29%, 37%, 44%, 50% (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100; CUN 100; PP 100)] chance to throw the target to the ground.  If the throw lands, the target will take [29, 39, 46, 53, 58 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100; CUN 100; PP 100)] damage and be dazed for 2 turns, or [44, 59, 70, 80, 89 (TL1-5; STR 100; DEX 100; CUN 100; PP 100)] damage and be stunned for 2 turns if the target is grappled.  You may attempt up to [0.0, 0.9, 1.5, 1.9, 2.2 (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100; CUN 10-100; PP 10-100)] throws per turn.

The chance of throwing increases with your Accuracy, the damage scales with your Physical Power, and the number of attempts with your Strength and Dexterity.
